cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "To cite the version of the proofs you used, see Zenodo (link pending)."
type: software
title: "FP: IEEE 754 arithmetic and floating-point numerical analysis in Lean"
authors:
  - given-names: "Marc A."
    family-names: "Tunnell"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-15"
license: "Apache-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tunnellm/lean-ieee754"
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 library for floating-point numerical error analysis, with traditional
  and mixed-error models, explicit IEEE 754 binary32/binary64 software arithmetic,
  summation and dot-product bounds, and compensated-reduction range certificates.
  Proofs establish the stated formal specifications and their qualifications;
  this release does not claim complete IEEE 754 or hardware conformance.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal verification
  - floating-point arithmetic
  - numerical analysis
  - IEEE 754
